# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Replaces the hand-applied Redirect Rules that
# docs/cloudflare-redirects-greptag-archive.md described — those are now in version
# control and deploy with the site.

# GrepTag and Comic Duplicate Scanner moved to mlogictech.com (2026-09-09) so
# bibliofuse.com presents one product. See docs/features/app-pages.md.
/:lang/grepreader/*  https://www.mlogictech.com/greptag  301
/:lang/grepreader    https://www.mlogictech.com/greptag  301
/:lang/archive/*     https://www.mlogictech.com/comic-duplicate-scanner  301
/:lang/archive       https://www.mlogictech.com/comic-duplicate-scanner  301
/:lang/blog/organize-ebooks-by-content-not-metadata  https://www.mlogictech.com/greptag  301

# /webapp/ was a landing page whose only job was linking out to a tool on another
# domain. The tool now lives here, so the landing page is gone.
/:lang/webapp/*      /:lang/tools/  301
/:lang/webapp        /:lang/tools/  301

# The QR generator moved under /tools/ with the rest of them.
/:lang/qr-generator/*  /:lang/tools/qr-generator/  301
/:lang/qr-generator    /:lang/tools/qr-generator/  301
